<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JUD" style="id">Jude</book>
  <para style="h">Jude</para>
  <para style="toc1">Jude</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jude</para>
  <para style="mt">Jude</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jesu Khris’ nasem khat le James’ sanggam pa Jude in, Pa Pasien sunga it le ngaite le Jesu Khris dinga a bihtaha kikem a kihlansate tungah lai kang hlah hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hepina, lungmuonna le itna tampite no-a’ hing hi taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka itte aw, na kung vuah i neiton uh hutdamna ka giel nuom mama laitahin, mi siengthote tungah a kimang den dinga khatvei beh a kipie tua upna adingin gal na do nading uh kutna lai giel ding a kisap lam ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile tanglai-a kipanin tami mawsah thukhenna a thuoh dinga eite lahah a na kisesa Pasien a zatah lo mi honkhat ang dap lut zo a, amate in i Pasien uh’ hepina pen numei-pasal thangtatna lamah hei-in eite in i neisun uh ahi Mangpa le Topa Jesu Khris a niel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A kicinga na theisa uh hizongle note in a kimang den dinga khatvei beh tawh a mite a hunkhie pa Topa in a nua ciengin Egypt gam hunkhie-in, a um lo mite a suhsietna thu kang phawhsah kia nuom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in ni thupi ni-in thukhenna thuoh dingin a panmun kemcing loin a tenna a nuasie vantung mite zong khuomiel thuhpi sungah tawntung siakhau tawh a khicip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sodom, Gomorrah le a kimvela om khuopi mite zong amate bangin gamta-in numei-pasal pahtatna le mihing ngaina dan ahi lo cilesa lunggulna lamah a kipumpieh ziehun mite’ ette dingin kumtawn meikuong tawh gawtna a thuoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi vangin tua bang ma-in mangmante in a tahsa uh a buasah vua, thuneina zong nielin a minthanna a neite a gensie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanle vantungmi mangpa Michael in dawimangpa tawh Moses luong kitu-in a kisel laitahun, dawimangpa tungah mawsah gensietna kammal zang ngam loin, “ Topa in nang ang phawhsie hi,” beh na ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hizongnanle tam mite in a thei lo uh thu khatpopo a mawh gensiet vua, ngaisutna a nei lo ganhingte bangin a pienpi lungsim utawh a thei uh thute in amate a susie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate in gimna a thuoh ding uhi! Bangzieh ahei cile sum nga thei nadingin Cain lampi zui-in Balaam khielna-ah amau le amau a kipiekhie vua, tuaci’n Korah ledona-ah a kisie sieng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua mite pen na itna pawi vua a nieh bangte ahi vua, zum mel nei loin no tawh an ne tonin amau le amau an kivate ahi uhi. Hui in a mut kawikawi guo lah a zusah bep lo meei tawh a kibang vua, amate ga a ga lo, nivei a si, a kiphungkal phalbi singkungte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amau’ maizumna pen a phuonsah tuipi huol husiete le a leng kawikawi aahsite tawh kibang ahi vua, amate adingin a tawntungin khuomiel thuhpi kikoipieh zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Adam panin a khang sagina Enoch in tami thute a na magen zo ta a, “En un, a misiengtho tul sawm tampite tawh Topa hing pei-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />mi zosie tungah thu khen ding le, milip in tua banga a bawl uh ahi Pasien zatah lo gamtat ziete le Pasien zatah lo mawneite in ama langpanin a gen khah uh kamkhau zosie a mawsah ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tam mite ahile a phun hatte le lungkim hun a nei ngai lote ahi uhi; a lunggulna bangun a gamta uhi; amate ahile kam dimdimin hamin a phattuom nading vua mi maipah siemte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahi vangin ka itte aw, i Topa Jesu Khris’ sawltahpite in na kung vua ang genkholsa thute phawh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile amate in, “Hun nukhia ciengin Pasien zatahna zie ahi lo a pumpi uh’ deigawna lam a zui mi simmawte ang pieng ding hi,” ci-in note tungah ang gen zo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua bang mite pen hlagau nei lo, kikhenna a piengsah a tahsa tai mite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanle no ka itte aw, a siengtho pen na upna uh tungah noma le noma kilam unlen, Hlagau Siengtho tawh thu ngen un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pasien’ itna sungah noma le noma kikem un; kumtawn hinna ang tun ding ahi i Topa Jesu Khris’ khuotuona na lamen bo un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A lungkaa mi pawlkhat khuotuo un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />meikuong sung panin midangte kaikhie-in hunkhie un; amau’ tahsa zieha a buabang a puonsilte nangawn uh muda-in zauna tawh midangte tungah khuotuona na nei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tu-in na pua lo nading vua ang kem zo pa, mawsahna om loin ama’ minthanna munah kipahna tawh ang tut zo pa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />i Topa Jesu Khris tungtawnin hunpa Pasien khat beh tungah minthanna thupina, vanglietna le thuneinate in a tawpsa hun zosie-a kipanin tu le kumtawnin hing om den taheh, Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
